category: Database
build-depends: cygport libfmt-devel libiodbc-devel libmariadb-devel libpq-devel libpq5 libsqlite3-devel
sdesc: "C++ Database Access Library (licensing & readmes)"
ldesc: "SOCI is a database access library for C++ that makes the illusion of embedding
SQL queries in the regular C++ code, staying entirely within the Standard C++."
